      "story_text": "\"Your stories are lovely. But I haven't fixed my plane, and we've no water left. I'd be happy to walk to a spring too.\" \"My friend the fox\u2014\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-24/page-compositions/c24-s01-p03/ASSEMBLY.md",
