        "CH03_S03:R",
        "CH24_S05:ONE"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"I'm thirsty too. Let's look for a well.\" I didn't think we could find a well in this great desert. But we began to walk.",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-24/page-compositions/c24-s01-p06/ASSEMBLY.md",
