        "CH24_S02:L",
        "CH24_S02:R"
      ],
      "story_text": "\"A house, the stars, the desert... What makes them beautiful is something we can't see.\" \"I'm glad you agree with my fox.\"",
      "assembly_instructions": "story-and-continuity/chapter-24/page-compositions/c24-s02-p08/ASSEMBLY.md",
